WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.200
We've got lot 4! Lot 4 here!
 How much for lot 4?

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.610
Thirty-five hundred!

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.640
Thirty-seven!

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:06.600
Forty!

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.980
And that's lot 4!

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>3</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>4</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>5</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>6</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>8</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>9</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>10</b>

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.570
A crystallized Kitetsu power source 
with 30 horsepower, sold for 4,000!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.340
Yes!

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.030
Bushi! Bushi! Bushi!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.240
This whole town is crawling with Bushi!

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.190
I've never seen anything like it!

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:25.910
What's up with that?

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.380
Oh, he's paying with Kitetsu.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.090
<b>Sen</b>

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:35.090
Business between Bushi bands 
uses Kitetsu as currency.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.140
All right, where're the Kitetsu Blades?

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:43.060
Kitetsu Blade auctions are the big draw,
 so they get saved for last.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.300
Huh, is that right?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.950
I can't wait to get my hands
 on a Kitetsu Blade!

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:24.030
<b>You
Can't
Survive
Underwater</b>

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.820
One second!

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.540
Here you go. Your 10 sen change.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:28.560
<b>Boiled
1 sen</b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:32.250
<b>Grilled, Salted Fish 
3 sen</b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:32.250
<b>Fish Grilled with Miso
2 sen</b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:32.250
<b>Miso Dengaku
 1 sen</b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:32.250
<b>Grilled, Salted
3 sen</b>

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.720
Say, what band are you guys from?

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:34.200
I mean...

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.580
Come to think of it, 
we never settled on a name.

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:40.400
A Bushi band that doesn't even have a name?!

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:44.670
Hey, sweetheart, how about you ditch 
these slobs and join up with us?

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:45.430
Nah...

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:47.530
Hey, give it a rest!

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:49.730
I'm just kidding with you! Just kidding!

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.600
Tch... I guess he's got us there.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:58.560
What has you two so gung-ho
about hunting oni in the first place?

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.230
Isn't that obvious?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.980
It's our dream, right, Kojiro?

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.990
R-Right...

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:11.630
Our dream's always been to become Bushi, 
 then make the strongest band ever!

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:18.620
I never really understand guys and the 
whole "I wanna be the very best" thing.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.420
<b>Her dream: To go home someday</b>

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.490
Kinda jaded, aren't you?

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.790
Well, there's one thing 
you need to figure out.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:25.620
What's that?

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.430
Which one of you is the captain?

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.490
I mean, if it's not clear who's in charge,

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.620
then you don't know who 
you're supposed to listen to.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:37.770
Kinda inconvenient.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.900
<b>The type 
to need 
direction</b>

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.740
The idea of one of us being 
in charge is kinda...

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:46.930
It's gotta be you, right, Kojiro?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.290
That was easy enough.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.520
A-Are you sure?

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.330
About what?

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.720
I mean, I don't even have a family name.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:05.800
<b>Takeda Band
 Captain: Takeda Naotora</b>

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.960
We've got the Takeda Band 
and the Kosameda Band...

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:05.800
<b>Kosameda Band
Captain: Kosameda Hideo</b>

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.500
Family name determines
 the band name, yeah?

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.100
<b>Kanemaki Band
 Captain: Kanemaki Kojiro</b>

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.100
So our captain's gotta be Kanemaki Kojiro!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.170
You feel me?

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:13.710
And you really don't mind?

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:14.880
Why would I?

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.360
Come on, man...

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.590
You're so competitive, 
I thought you would want it.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:22.930
"I'm stronger, so I get to be captain!"
 That kind of thing.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:23.830
Nah.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.290
I'm happy as long as we can 
chase our dream together.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:32.480
So Kojiro is my new lord?

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.580
I wish your eyes weren't 
sparkling like that...

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.850
And now the moment
 you've all been waiting for!

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.830
It's time for the Kitetsu Blade auction!

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:47.710
We have 25 pieces here from the 
master smiths of the Ryuzoji Band!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:52.920
Let those of you who would 
lay claim to one come forth!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:56.670
Those are Kitetsu Blades? They're beautiful!

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.210
And they look expensive...

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.770
There's a whole bunch!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.760
How am I gonna choose?

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.240
Whichever you fall in love with 
 at a glance is right.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.920
A katana and a Bushi are drawn to each other.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.440
Just go after whichever 
one grabs your fancy.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.160
Of course, madam!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.250
"Madam"?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.780
You look lovely, by the way!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.130
I'm no madam, boy.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.080
The name's Osafune Mitsuru, and I'm the 
head of the Ryuzoji Band smiths.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.830
Of course, Miss Mitsuru!

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.820
<i>He didn't react at all when I 
took my top off in front of him.</i>

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.270
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.430
<b>Likes older women</b>

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.980
Still, I've never picked out 
a Kitetsu Blade before...

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.010
Oh, it's your first time?

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:39.570
This is a big day for you, then.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:40.690
It is?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:41.400
Of course.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:46.900
Choosing a Kitetsu Blade is as a rite
as important as coming of age.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.580
And that's because obtaining a 
Kitetsu Blade that can slay oni

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.710
is the moment that you come 
into your own as a Bushi.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.860
Coming into your own as a Bushi...

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:58.670
I like the sound of that!

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:06.250
Now then, everyone, please stand before the 
blade that you would claim as your own!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:10.800
This one?

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.100
Or maybe this one?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.910
And what about this one?

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.760
Not very decisive, are you, Kojiro?

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:23.880
Musashi? Are you sure you wanna 
pick such a plain katana?

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:24.610
Yeah.

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:27.310
I think this is the right one.

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.520
<i>The boy's got a good eye.</i>

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.950
<i>No one's paying this katana any mind...</i>

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:39.900
<i>Reminds me of myself.</i>

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.860
I'm going with this one.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.100
<i>That's a good choice as well.</i>

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:47.610
Number one has selected the 
Kitetsu Blade "Enma's Oodachi."

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:48.970
One-sixth alloy!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.330
Number two has selected the Kitetsu 
Blade "Vorpal Cherry Blossoms."

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.670
One-sixth alloy!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.770
Wait, has the auction started? 
What am I supposed to do?

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.160
Did you think this was a regular auction?

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.130
Grab ahold of the hilt.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:05.980
What? We can pick them up already?

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:07.950
All right!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.150
This is...

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:13.910
Huh?

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.570
What happened to Musashi?

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.530
He's going through the sword's trial.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.750
A Kitetsu Blade auction 
isn't like anything else.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.500
You compete by testing 
your potential as Bushi.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:33.090
You could say it's a ritual where the 
Kitetsu Blade chooses its master.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.250
A sword choosing its master?

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.010
I didn't know that was a thing.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:41.350
It's hard to describe, but when you pick
 one up, you get this strange feeling.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:47.350
Anyway, once this ritual is over, 
you're able to use the Kitetsu Blade!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.820
Okay.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.090
<i>The trial of the sword</i>

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:56.570
<i>refers to the special phenomenon that occurs 
when a human picks up a Kitetsu Blade.</i>

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.500
<i>From the moment you grasp the hilt...</i>

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.790
<i>It's like the sword's going inside me!</i>

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:11.430
<i>As your pulse quickens, it feels as if 
something is coursing through your body...</i>

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:15.000
<i>Those who have gone through the experience</i>

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.170
<i>recount seeing their life 
flash before their eyes.</i>

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:23.650
<i>And after overcoming the near-death 
experience that makes up the ritual...</i>

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:32.100
<i>the sword will light up, with wings of 
glowing stone erupting from the user's body!</i>

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:39.280
Number Two has completed 
Vorpal Cherry Blossoms' trial!

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.450
<i>What was that...?</i>

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.400
Congratulations, Kojiro!

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:45.530
This proves that Kitetsu Blade 
has chosen you as its master.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.740
Notice how it kinda feels different?

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:49.890
Yeah.

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:53.990
It feels so natural.
It's like the sword's a part of my body.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:56.810
I've got a connection to it, 
like it's a living thing!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.850
So this is my new sword!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.430
Good!

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.540
Number five has completed his sword's trial!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.520
I did it!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.350
Number seven has also passed!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.730
Huh... Everyone's passing pretty easily.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:17.760
But the glowing colors around them
are all different.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:19.840
That's the color of their souls.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.050
A Bushi's soul has a color to it,

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:30.510
and the minerals in those katanas
 shine to match their color.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.050
There are five colors in total.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:35.710
And depending on the color, 
a Kitetsu Blade can use different powers.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:39.340
It looks like yours is blue.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.980
Blue?

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.240
Is that special or something?!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.060
Nah, it's pretty normal.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.780
Normal, huh?

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:50.370
About a fourth of the folks 
in our band are blue.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:54.390
Other than that, there's green, 
yellow, white, and red.

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:58.070
You wanna have at least person 
in your band who's red.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:04.410
Now, let's see what Musashi's color is!

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:10.250
<i>What's this weird feeling?</i>

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:15.450
<i>It's so dark... and my heart is pounding.</i>

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.870
<i>Hey, I can see something.</i>

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.260
<i>I don't wanna get near it, though...</i>

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.180
<i>I have a bad feeling.</i>

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.100
<i>This is...</i>

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.430
<i>Tatsuyama?</i>

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:31.870
<i>Am I back home?</i>

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.110
<i>No...</i>

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.530
<i>This is...</i>

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:44.750
<i>back when...</i>

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:45.710
<i>Pops!</i>

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:57.610
<i>Wait! What did you say, Pops?!</i>

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.240
<i>What was that?</i>

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.520
<i>Why am I seeing the past?</i>

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:09.500
<i>What's the deal with these Kitetsu Blades?!</i>

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.440
<i>It's so dark, I can't see anything...</i>

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.160
Hey, what's going on here?!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:40.930
<i>What is this?</i>

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:44.090
<i>It feels really familiar.</i>

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:50.140
<i>Are you trying to say something?
 I can't hear you.</i>

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.320
<i>She's... so warm.</i>

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.510
<i>It's reassuring.</i>

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.180
Do... eed...

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:22.620
Don't... need...

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:26.090
<i>What is this?! She really 
is saying something!</i>

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:29.940
I don't need you.

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:34.420
Number ten has completed his sword trial.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.610
I did it!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:38.330
Is Musashi still at it?

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.970
It's black.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.120
He's forsaken...

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.260
Are you okay, Musashi?!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.650
Did you hurt yourself?

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:07.720
Nah, I'm fine...

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:11.300
Boss, what was that darkness?

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:14.680
I've never actually seen a 
sword trial like this...

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:18.830
But I've heard stories. 
The stuff of legends, really.

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.140
The problem is...

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:23.500
You were in the middle of your sword trial!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.400
Did you realize you dropped it?

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.990
Did I? I better try again.

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:32.250
<i>I was just seeing things. 
I'm sure it'll be fine this time.</i>

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:38.500
Seventeen and eighteen have 
succeeded in their sword trials!

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:41.650
I can do it... this time...

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:47.180
Dammit! Why am I the only 
one who ends up like this?!

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.330
So heavy...!

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:54.750
Are you sure you're okay?

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.330
You've tried with six swords.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.400
I'm totally fine...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.590
Seventh's the charm...

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:00.620
It's not happening.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:05.480
I'm sorry, Red, but you 
can't use Kitetsu Blades.

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:06.460
He can't?

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:07.570
What do you mean?

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:10.780
Those whose souls manifest in that black,

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:14.030
burnt-out color are said to be 
rejected by all Kitetsu Blades.

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.240
They're forsaken.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:21.410
But... if I work at it, 
I'll be able to use one, right?

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:22.970
Won't I?!

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.420
It's impossible.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.830
There's no changing the color of your soul.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.690
If yours is blue, it stays that way. 
If it's green, it's green for life.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.260
You have to accept it.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:41.600
As sure as people can't 
breathe underwater

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.820
or survive amidst flames...

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.630
Your soul is black.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:50.030
And you'll never use Kitetsu Blades.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.730
It's just the way you were made.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.170
You'll have to give it up.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.620
Give up what?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:07.000
Becoming a Bushi.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:15.430
<i>Give up becoming a Bushi...</i>

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.400
<i>What does that even mean?</i>

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:23.130
You can't be a Bushi 
without a Kitetsu Blade

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:25.330
since you can't hunt oni.

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:28.710
A band member who can't hunt oni

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:32.930
can still stay at the castle, 
tending fields and horses.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:37.050
Don't let it get you down, kid.
 It's a fine way of life.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.330
I get it.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.210
This means I can't hunt oni.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:52.150
<i>Wait, that means my dream from back then...</i>

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.410
<i>No, it can't be.</i>

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.270
Kojiro?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:03.210
Did you pass your sword trial okay?

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.230
Yeah.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:06.690
Oh yeah? That's great.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.060
Um, listen. For now, why don't you guys—

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.130
What the hell are these things?!

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.150
Enemy attack! A Kishin has descended!

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.200
A Kishin has descended!

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:24.670
A Kishin?!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.310
The Kishin itself has 
taken up atop the summit

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.880
and is sending its lesser oni 
down to attack!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.520
Lesser oni?

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:32.330
These things...

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.800
are supposed to be <i>lesser</i>?

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.530
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.760
I wasn't this scared before...

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:49.820
<i>That's it... It's because I know the truth.</i>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.780
<i>If I can't break their horns, 
I can't beat these things.</i>

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:55.240
<i>And now that I know that...</i>

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:05.700
Kojiro?

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.220
It's a lesser oni attack!

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.810
Run! They're going to eat everything!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.010
Give me my sword back!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.000
It's going to eat us!

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.570
Mommy!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.520
My arm's on fire!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.130
I can cut it!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.340
Th... Thank you!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.550
You saved our lives!

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.510
Thank you, Mister!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.240
You're thanking me...?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.980
<i>It's because of the sword...</i>

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:29.640
<i>With this, I can help people 
and they'll actually be grateful!</i>

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:34.620
<i>That never happened even once back home.</i>

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:37.320
<i>Is this oni hunting?</i>

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:40.310
<i>Is this what it's like?!</i>

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:41.960
Okay!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.110
Go!

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:44.750
You can do it!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.140
So this is an oni hunt, huh?

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.950
You can't do anything without 
a Kitetsu Blade, can you?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:57.620
You're that redhead who failed 
the sword trial before, right?

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.210
You'll have to give up on a Kitetsu Blade.

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:01.760
Come on, it's not like it's set in stone...

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:03.880
You're a real stubborn one, aren't you?

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:06.460
Why do you want a Kitetsu Blade
 so bad anyway?

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:08.410
Why?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.160
Because...

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.850
The bull oni have all been slain!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.670
You did a good job out there, blondie!

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:22.310
He sure did. 
That was a hell of a first fight!

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.370
Kojiro!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.700
Your hands.

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:31.580
My hands?

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.730
We slap 'em together 
like this to celebrate!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.740
W-We do?

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:40.900
<i>Kojiro looks happy.</i>

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.360
<i>Check it out, Kojiro.</i>

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.890
<i>There are these oni 
monsters outside of town,</i>

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.830
<i>and the Bushi are the ones who fight them.</i>

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:50.340
<i>Isn't that cool?!</i>

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.060
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:03.720
<i>I see... I get it now.</i>

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:06.530
<i>I wish...</i>

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:10.850
<i>I could have joined him.</i>

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.410
<i>But...</i>

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:17.970
<i>Without a Kitetsu Blade, I can't fight.</i>

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:21.390
Anyone with a Kitetsu Blade, 
head up the mountain!

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:23.250
It's time to slay the Kishin!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.850
We better go too, Kojiro.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:26.660
Right.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.230
Musashi!

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.040
Kojiro...

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:34.440
Get going, man.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.600
Are we gonna just leave him?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:45.690
I think... that's for the best right now.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:01.640
<i>Dammit... Dammit!</i>

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:04.690
<i>I have to find some way to fight!</i>

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:06.850
<i>I've gotta do something.</i>

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.320
<i>But what options are there?</i>

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:11.520
<i>What's the difference between 
me and everyone else?</i>

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.810
They all had light coming 
from their Kitetsu Blades...

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:17.990
Light? Wait a second...

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:23.390
I did that this morning.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.670
Hey! How you doing?

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:30.300
It's you!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.780
I saw everything.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.610
Your whole sword trial.

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:36.600
Looks like that black fighting aura 
gave you a bit of trouble, huh?

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:39.480
What is this?! 
Are you here to make fun of me?

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:41.240
Not at all!

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:45.020
It turns out you and me 
have a lot in common.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.240
That's...

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.990
I know where you belong...

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.620
And it's with us.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:27.610
<b>Tsugumi's diary</b>

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:27.210
It's Tsugumi's diary! Let's see here...

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:32.040
<i>Your Lordship, I've learned Musashi is like 
a father and Kojiro is like a mother...</i>

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.140
"I'm really glad I met them."

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:35.940
Brings a tear to your eye...

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:39.100
<i>But they both have terrible B.O.! 
And their feet stink!</i>

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Time
The Obsidian Goddess</b>
